      "body": "Issue: Qwen3.5 and Qwen3.6 INT4 AWQ fail on TP4 with tensor size mismatch 0 vs 2\n\nRoot cause: auto_round_kernel's QuantLinear preallocates buffers with floor-rounded shapes (e.g. qzeros width `out // 32 * bits`), which become 0 for narrow TP shards such as Qwen3.5 GDN in_proj_ba at TP=4, causing copy_() to fail with a shape mismatch.\n\nFixed: Assign the loaded qweight/qzeros/scales directly instead, since post_init() only relies on the actual tensor shapes.\n\n",
